## How to use this file in the exercise

1. Add this file to the agent's files when you create it, or attach it in chat.
2. Ask the agent: *"Run this morning's invoice check on the new invoices in the sample file and show me the summary you would post."*
3. Compare its summary with your own check of the six invoices and the supplier email.
